- card_present_fraud or card_not_present_fraud → close_and_reissue;
- unauthorized_transaction → freeze_pending_investigation;
- all others → keep_active.
For an ATM cash discrepancy where the recorded withdrawal is higher than the cash received, the disputed_amount is the recorded withdrawal minus the cash received. For a Rho-Bank ATM claim that was not validated (recorded withdrawal equal to the cash received), the disputed_amount is the figure confirmed with the customer in rho_atm_not_validated.
